{"availability":"available","full":"hoangsonww/Customizable-AI-Chatbot","name":"Customizable-AI-Chatbot","description":"🧬 Build your own conversational AI in minutes (or seconds) with this customizable chatbot template, utilizing modern technologies like Next.js, Tailwind CSS, RAG, Pinecone, and powerful LLM/GenAI APIs (with chunk streaming!) including OpenAI, Fireworks AI, and Anthropic AI. Time to unleash your creativity and transform ideas into reality! 🚀","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":25,"forks":15,"created":"2025-02-27T02:55:35Z","updated":"2026-09-27T19:40:54Z","license":null,"branch":"master","homepage":"https://customizable-ai-chatbot.vercel.app","topics":["airflow","anthropic","artificial-intelligence","fireworks","fullstack-development","machine-learning","natural-language-processing","next","nextjs","nlp","openai","pinecone","rag","responsive-design","retrieval-augmented-generation","tailwindcss","transformers","typescript","vector","vercel"],"demo":"https://customizable-ai-chatbot.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:11.601Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:11.601Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:11.601Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:29:11.601Z","stars":25,"forks":15}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A fully customizable RAG AI chatbot built with modern web technologies. This project is designed to let you tailor every aspect of your chatbot, from its appearance and messaging to the underlying AI integrations. With support for advanced technologies such as Next.js, Tailwind CSS, RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation), Pinecone, and multiple AI APIs (OpenAI, Fireworks AI, Anthropic AI), this solution makes deploying your own conversational AI a breeze.","Are you ready to build your own AI chatbot in minutes? Let's get started! 🚀","This project is a Customizable AI Chatbot that allows you to easily modify and deploy a conversational AI assistant. It is designed to answer a wide range of questions—including those about its creator, Son (David) Nguyen, as well as general inquiries—by integrating multiple AI APIs. The chatbot leverages RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) to provide more accurate responses by managing document vectors with Pinecone."],"features":["Dynamic Chat Interface: Modern, responsive UI with smooth animations.","Enhanced with Streaming: The app spits out chatbot responses as they are generated, providing a more interactive experience.","Advanced AI Integration: Connects to multiple AI APIs (OpenAI, Fireworks AI, Anthropic AI) to generate rich, context-aware responses.","RAG & Pinecone: Upserts document vectors into a Pinecone index for accurate retrieval and augmented generation.","RAG Loader: Comes with a tool to upload documents to Pinecone for RAG, ensuring even beginners can set up the RAG system."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hoangsonww/Customizable-AI-Chatbot/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"7f96269878a9211116c2616e1f859f54e673f521f6edac5c3a8e45cb30c94353","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:11.750Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:11.750Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A fully customizable RAG AI chatbot built with modern web technologies. This project is designed to let you tailor every aspect of your chatbot, from its appearance and messaging to the underlying AI integrations. With support for advanced technologies such as Next.js, Tailwind CSS, RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation), Pinecone, and multiple AI APIs (OpenAI, Fireworks AI, Anthropic AI), this solution makes deploying your own conversational AI a breeze.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hoangsonww/Customizable-AI-Chatbot/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"> [!CAUTION] > IMPORTANT: Before starting the project, you need to set up accounts with the following services to obtain API keys.","sourceUrl":"https://g